                "title": "Contemporary Leverset, Baldwin 5460V",
                "description": "Baldwin's Contemporary Leverset features a modern, minimalistic design. It has concealed mounting screws for a sleek look. Made out of solid brass, it is available in beautiful finishes. It is designed to conceal a 2-1/8 inch predrilled door. For doors 1-3/8 inches thick with optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
